\f0\fs24 \cf0 DATA FLOW:\
BSJ IOT Camera \uc0\u8594  MQTT/WebSocket \u8594  IoTility Backend \u8594  WebSocket \u8594  Frontend\
\
BSJ IOT provides:\
- Real-time event stream via their API/MQTT\
- Event data: device_id, event_type, timestamp, gps, speed, thumbnails\
- Video: stored on BSJ cloud, accessible via their video API\
\
IoTility backend does:\
- Map BSJ device_id \uc0\u8594  vehicleId \u8594  driverId\
- Enrich event with: driverName, fleetId, jobId, routeRunId\
- Calculate safety score impact\
- Store in IoTility events table\
- Push to frontend via WebSocket\
\
IoTility frontend receives:\
- Pre-enriched events with full context\
- No direct BSJ API calls from frontend\
\
DB Table: dashcam_events\
  id, deviceId (BSJ), vehicleId FK, driverId FK\
  jobId FK (nullable), routeRunId FK (nullable)\
  eventType, severity, category\
  timestamp, lat, lng, speed\
  thumbnailUrls: string[] (BSJ CDN URLs)\
  videoUrl: string (BSJ CDN)\
  reviewStatus: 'unreviewed'|'acknowledged'|'violation'|'false-positive'\
  reviewedBy: userId FK, reviewedAt: timestamp\
  reviewNote: string\
  scoreImpact: number (negative, e.g. -8)\
  createdAt: timestamp\
\
BSJ IOT API integration:\
GET  https://bsj-api/events          \uc0\u8594  fetch events\
GET  https://bsj-api/stream/:id      \uc0\u8594  live video stream URL\
GET  https://bsj-api/playback/:id    \uc0\u8594  recorded video URL\
POST https://bsj-api/devices/command \uc0\u8594  send command to device (e.g. capture photo)\
